---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "$49 New Patient Dental Special in Tempe, AZ"
description: "New to 3rd Set Smiles? See what's included in our $49 new-patient dental offer for patients without insurance and book your visit online in Tempe."
permalink: /special-offers/
breadcrumb:
  - { label: "Home", url: "/" }
  - { label: "Special Offers", url: "/special-offers/" }
---

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep">›</span>Special Offers</div>
    <h1>$49 New Patient Dental <span>Special in Tempe</span></h1>
    <p class="lede">New to 3rd Set Smiles and without insurance? Get a comprehensive exam, digital X-rays &amp; a cleaning for just $49 — request your visit below and we'll confirm within one business day.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="offers-section" aria-labelledby="offers-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="offers-head">
      <div class="section-label" style="color:var(--gold-light)">Current specials</div>
      <h2 id="offers-heading">Ways to save at 3rd Set Smiles</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="offers-grid">

      <article class="offer-card">
        <div class="offer-card-top"><span class="section-label">New patients</span><span class="offer-badge">$49</span></div>
        <h3>New-patient exam, X-rays &amp; cleaning</h3>
        <ul class="offer-list">
          <li>Comprehensive exam &amp; oral-cancer screening</li>
          <li>Full-mouth digital X-rays</li>
          <li>Healthy-mouth cleaning</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/book/?appointmentType=new-patient&amp;source=new-patient-offer" class="btn-primary" data-action="new-patient-offer-booking">Book Your $49 Visit</a>
      </article>

      <article class="offer-card">
        <div class="offer-card-top"><span class="section-label">Wisdom teeth</span><span class="offer-badge">Free</span></div>
        <h3>Free wisdom teeth consult + panoramic X-ray</h3>
        <ul class="offer-list">
          <li>Panoramic X-ray &amp; an honest answer</li>
          <li>Simple extractions from $149 per tooth</li>
          <li>Students save 15% with a valid ID</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/book/?appointmentType=wisdom-teeth-consult&amp;source=wisdom-teeth-offer" class="btn-primary" data-action="booking-cta" data-source="wisdom-teeth-offer">Book Your Free Consult</a>
      </article>

      <article class="offer-card">
        <div class="offer-card-top"><span class="section-label">Dental emergency</span><span class="offer-badge">$59</span></div>
        <h3>Same-day emergency exam + X-ray</h3>
        <ul class="offer-list">
          <li>Seen same-day when available</li>
          <li>Focused exam + the X-ray we need</li>
          <li>Honest treatment options, no surprises</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/book/?appointmentType=emergency&amp;source=emergency" class="btn-primary" data-action="emergency-booking" data-source="emergency">Book an Emergency Visit</a>
      </article>

      <article class="offer-card">
        <div class="offer-card-top"><span class="section-label">Back to school</span><span class="offer-badge">$79</span></div>
        <h3>Custom sports mouthguard + checkup</h3>
        <ul class="offer-list">
          <li>Custom-fit — better than boil-and-bite</li>
          <li>Pairs with an exam &amp; cleaning</li>
          <li>Students save 15% with a valid ID</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/book/?appointmentType=new-patient&amp;source=back-to-school-offer" class="btn-primary" data-action="booking-cta" data-source="back-to-school-offer">Book a Back-to-School Visit</a>
      </article>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section contact-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="contact-wrap">

      <div class="contact-info">
        <div class="fade-in">
          <h2>What your $49 visit includes</h2>
          <p>A relaxed, no-pressure first visit with Dr. Phillips — time to understand your mouth and your goals before anything else.</p>
          <ul class="checklist">
            <li>Comprehensive exam, including an oral-cancer screening</li>
            <li>Full-mouth digital X-rays</li>
            <li>A healthy-mouth cleaning</li>
            <li>A written summary and honest options — no pressure to commit</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="fade-in">
          <div class="section-label" style="color:var(--gold-light);margin-top:8px">Also available to new patients</div>
          <ul class="checklist">
            <li><strong>Free implant consultation</strong> — single-tooth or <a href="/services/all-on-4/">full-arch</a>, with a written treatment plan and transparent pricing.</li>
            <li><strong>Whitening with your cleaning</strong> — custom take-home trays at a reduced rate.</li>
            <li><strong>Veteran &amp; uninsured discounts</strong> — we're a veteran-owned practice and glad to help.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="fade-in">
          <div class="contact-detail">
            <div class="contact-detail-label">Prefer to book by phone?</div>
            <div class="contact-detail-value"><a href="tel:{{ site.phone.telShort }}" data-action="call-offer">{{ site.phone.display }}</a></div>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-detail">
            <div class="contact-detail-label">Hours</div>
            <div class="contact-detail-value">
              {{ site.hours.display }}<br>
              <span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55)">{{ site.hours.weekend }}</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {# Anchor target for the offer-band CTA — lands directly on the form card,
         with scroll-margin to clear the fixed top banner (var(--banner-h)) + nav (72px). #}
      <div class="contact-form-wrap fade-in" id="request" style="scroll-margin-top:calc(92px + var(--banner-h))">
        {% set formId = "offer" %}
        {% set formHeading = "Claim your $49 new-patient visit" %}
        {% set formIntro = "New patient without insurance? Send your details and we'll confirm your $49 exam, X-rays & cleaning within one business day." %}
        {% set formReason = "New patient exam & cleaning" %}
        {% include "partials/contact-form.njk" %}
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container-narrow prose">
    <p class="muted" style="text-align:center">Offers cannot be combined with insurance benefits and apply to new patients where indicated. Students save 15% on treatment with a valid student ID. Subject to change without notice.</p>
    <ul class="muted offer-terms">
      <li><strong>$49 new-patient visit:</strong> for patients without insurance; excludes deep (periodontal) cleanings and treatment-related X-rays.</li>
      <li><strong>Free wisdom teeth consult:</strong> complimentary consultation &amp; panoramic X-ray; simple single-tooth extractions from $149, with surgical, impacted, or multiple-tooth cases and sedation quoted at your consultation.</li>
      <li><strong>$59 emergency visit:</strong> a limited, problem-focused exam plus a necessary X-ray; treatment to resolve the problem is quoted separately.</li>
      <li><strong>$79 custom sports mouthguard:</strong> includes a same-visit exam &amp; cleaning.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
